        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make yakiimo (roasted sweet potatoes) on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the heat just right while serving orders one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your remaining sweet potato stock and time your restocks carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a new high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yakiimo to order and serve them to your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast them perfectly without burning for maximum points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many you can make before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place the sweet potatoes on the stone grill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. When one side is done, flip them over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When both sides are done, bag them up and serve to the customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score as high as you can and climb the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast sweet potatoes with precision, fulfill more and more orders, and aim for a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can face off in a test of skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a red-hot competition where speed and accuracy determine the winner!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make yakiimo (roasted sweet potatoes) on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the heat just right while serving orders one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your remaining sweet potato stock and time your restocks carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a new high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yakiimo to order and serve them to your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast them perfectly without burning for maximum points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many you can make before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place the sweet potatoes on the stone grill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. When one side is done, flip them over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When both sides are done, bag them up and serve to the customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score as high as you can and climb the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast sweet potatoes with precision, fulfill more and more orders, and aim for a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can face off in a test of skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a red-hot competition where speed and accuracy determine the winner!</p>",
